 "875909670960284", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974554_875909674293617_6894347120185569387_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5yupZFbhiiYQ7kNvwH1t-a6&_nc_oc=AdogUkR8lBQoFyFWbX5NAY0daoFgqvuxCW534MlxJ-EuyLhScF5JkpK7GTZMYABW4JQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTEk2kiJtZgAh24vQLCIWLdZmBQxC1gJAIV2eXyvR3TvQ&oe=6AFDCE4B"}, {"file_name": "Screen_2_Toilet_Passthrough.png", "id": "399092643246026", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003226_399092653246025_3513024666909186113_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W-kpLdjAXDgQ7kNvwFAwTNE&_nc_oc=AdrgTnEEanxllhtsJLlqaP6KSJvexsp7Xb_pfWUbMk1HXNjcOO68JIpACQUSZYe-2BY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ800k-UvSUjsXslhEh_WD7Ic0_TeTT-0g5QpnxzaZzkg&oe=6AFDBC4C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_v1_FencesA.png", "id": "1809628033134368", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982612_1809628036467701_5448370794054911283_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vHh3jo8bY6MQ7kNvwEG6vrH&_nc_oc=Adr4K4f1vzuXF64m1VLEsjEt1hlWIEyg0RorfoqBuUpCKkVzXmV_taWqKt_0X7DVblk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTvtaqYrbXASOwZBAEP_J1LQU154MhrCo7oUY8vm2iJ9A&oe=6AFDD230"}, {"file_name": "Screen_Preorder_v1_PlanetRings.png", "id": "1010280957553281", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75254872_1010280960886614_8548514678587306840_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zXidG8PytBoQ7kNvwE7xyYV&_nc_oc=Adr0VKEKFExnOhp50XtKFrAM5fXU1IIxReLGtjq6k0GUjC1cd0nu8rkEJTjfqFL6Sio&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSzOE99a03SJ0_tMxs-OfCwD-dhGh00VGjAYyflkjU6Kg&oe=6AFDD67B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerThumbnail.png", "id": "510259041956853", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982674_510259045290186_8234367733913918752_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YmzL6qcAPUcQ7kNvwFWKYMe&_nc_oc=AdqPTOBBmgQrOflL1L7zCINY4nDEvBaHVJ2R3epUr8n9G4jPzIXNGdN-wFpbnT7FE3k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSTzJAmnW82XYPMTJEAvKH9WifCNrFbwPwpCZGHiUPykw&oe=6AFDE2C7"}, "display_name": "Snapstick", "keywords": ["puzzle", "funny", "build", "easy", "slapstick"], "long_description": "Snapstick is a **perfectly normal puzzle game** about connecting things together. It's perfect for normal people. Okay? Okay. Don't worry about it.\n\n\n# WHAT'S IN THE BOX?\n* 500+ puzzles by the multi-award-winning designer of Linelight\n* 60+ original mechanics\n* A memorable cast of very normal characters\n* Featuring music by the legendary Grant Kirkhope (Banjo-Kazooie, GoldenEye 007)\n* ...And much, much more!!!\n* Anti-climatic bullet points\n\n# PUZZLES, PUZZLES, PUZZLES\nBuild objects, solve 3D mazes, build coasters, bounce lasers, and much more. Scratch itches deep in your brain.\n{1223440118880908}\n\n# PLAY CUPID\nThis dog is a normal character with a normal storyline.\n{495296376732218}\n\n# SHADOW WORK\nPlay with size, rotation, and light. This part is pretty shady.\n{3925841577697925}\n\n# RUNNING JOKES\nWe apologize for nothing.\n{1747873889318890}\n\n# HANDS ON\nOptionally ditch those controllers and get fully immersed. Experience a white-glove service!\n{1057724902413239}", "short_description": "Snapstick is a perfectly normal puzzle game for perfectly normal people. It's filled with great puzzles, terrible jokes, and chock-full o' variety and surprises. Expect the unexpected.\n\nDO: Assemble roller coasters, match shadows to silhouettes, connect streets to unite dogs, bounce laser beams, and MANY more."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mydogzorro.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "My Dog